+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `availability(query)` to the rental service. The query contains `start`, `end`, and an optional
+`kind` (`board` or `sail`). Return sorted equipment IDs matching that kind, or all kinds if omitted,
+that are free for the entire valid UTC period. A booking conflicts when its period overlaps the query;
+period ends remain exclusive. Document the public API.
